{"id": "morgan", "name": "Elise", "title": "客戶負責人", "hook": "大單前夜，酒廊「只係傾生意」。", "start": "m1", "portrait": "./assets/stills/vera-02.jpg", "tint": "amber", "chatName": "Elise", "nodes": {"m1": {"id": "m1", "label": "酒廊 21:10", "scene": "lounge", "text": "落地玻璃外係維港夜燈。Elise 轉酒杯，戒指敲一下杯壁。\n\n「合約數字我哋日頭講完。夜晚……講人。」", "thought": "佢望住你，唔望海。", "aside": "爵士樂壓得好低。", "choices": [{"label": "「人同單，邊樣先成交？」", "next": "m2a", "heat": 8, "tension": 6, "cg": true}, {"label": "「我嚟係收條款。」", "next": "m2b", "tension": 10}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["人", "成交", "邊樣", "人同單", "先成交", "想聽", "答案", "坐近"], "next": "m2a", "heat": 8, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……你問成交。我聽。"}, {"keys": ["條款", "收條款", "紙", "合約", "簽", "生意"], "next": "m2b", "tension": 10, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……條款。好。推紙過嚟。"}, {"keys": ["坐近", "近一格", "靠近", "想聽邊種"], "next": "m2c", "heat": 14, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……你坐近。我當答咗一半。"}]}, "m2a": {"id": "m2a", "label": "交你講", "scene": "lounge", "text": "Elise 笑得淡。「成交？你先講你想要邊樣。人，定條款。」", "thought": "話事權交返你。", "aside": "杯壁再敲一聲。", "choices": [{"label": "「兩樣都要。」", "next": "m3a", "heat": 10, "cg": true}, {"label": "「先條款。」", "next": "m3b", "tension": 6}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["兩者", "都要", "人先", "溫度"], "next": "m3a", "heat": 10, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……兩樣。大膽。"}, {"keys": ["先條款", "條款", "紙"], "next": "m3b", "tension": 6, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……先條款。得。"}]}, "m2b": {"id": "m2b", "label": "收條款", "scene": "lounge", "text": "「條款？得。你推紙過嚟。我簽之前，你要先答一條。」", "thought": "紙喇中間，人喇對面。", "aside": "筆帽未開。", "choices": [{"label": "「問。」", "next": "m3b", "tension": 8}, {"label": "（推近）「你先講你想要乜。」", "next": "m3a", "heat": 12, "cg": true}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["問", "答", "講"], "next": "m3b", "tension": 8, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……問。你答。"}, {"keys": ["推近", "想要乜", "人", "近"], "next": "m3a", "heat": 12, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……你推近。好。"}]}, "m2c": {"id": "m2c", "label": "坐近", "scene": "lounge", "text": "「你坐近，我當你已經答咗一半。」Elise 轉杯，眼光落喇你手上。", "thought": "距離縮咗，規矩未寫。", "aside": "爵士低音再近一格。", "choices": [{"label": "「另一半你講。」", "next": "m3a", "heat": 12, "cg": true}, {"label": "「我只係坐近聽清楚。」", "next": "m3b", "tension": 4}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["另一半", "你講", "講"], "next": "m3a", "heat": 12, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……另一半。我講。"}, {"keys": ["聽清楚", "只係", "坐近"], "next": "m3b", "tension": 4, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……聽清楚。好。"}]}, "m3a": {"id": "m3a", "label": "兩樣", "scene": "lounge", "text": "「夠膽。大單前夜，人同條款一齊要。」Elise 指尖輕點你手背。", "thought": "點一下，比簽字重。", "aside": "窗外燈火慢閃。", "choices": [{"label": "「再近啲講。」", "next": "m4b", "heat": 14, "cg": true}, {"label": "「我只簽紙。」", "next": "m4c", "tension": 8}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["再近", "近啲", "私下", "指尖", "溫度"], "next": "m4b", "heat": 14, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……再近。得。"}, {"keys": ["只簽", "簽紙", "紙"], "next": "m4c", "tension": 8, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……只簽紙。明智。"}]}, "m3b": {"id": "m3b", "label": "先條款", "scene": "lounge", "text": "「條款清楚。人呢？你仲未答。」Elise 將筆推到你面前。", "thought": "筆比問題更近。", "aside": "杯底餘溫。", "choices": [{"label": "「人可以後補。」", "next": "m4c", "tension": 6}, {"label": "「人而家補。」", "next": "m4b", "heat": 12, "cg": true}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["後補", "人可以", "之後"], "next": "m4c", "tension": 6, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……後補。得。"}, {"keys": ["而家", "人而家", "補", "人"], "next": "m4b", "heat": 12, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……而家補。好。"}]}, "m4b": {"id": "m4b", "label": "再近", "scene": "lounge", "text": "「再近？酒廊鏡頭得大堂有，呢角無。」Elise 聲低。", "thought": "角位比合約安全。", "aside": "爵士蓋過呼吸。", "choices": [{"label": "「我自己碰下。」", "next": "m5v", "heat": 14, "cg": true}, {"label": "「簽完再近。」", "next": "m4a", "heat": 8}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["碰", "溫度", "量", "近"], "next": "m5v", "heat": 14, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……你自己碰。"}, {"keys": ["簽", "簽完", "紙"], "next": "m4a", "heat": 8, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……簽完。再近。"}]}, "m4a": {"id": "m4a", "label": "點完簽", "scene": "lounge", "text": "「簽之前，你先碰一下燈是否熱。」Elise 拉你隻手去玻璃度。", "thought": "玻璃涼，手熱。", "aside": "霧開始起。", "choices": [{"label": "「碰完。」", "next": "m5v", "heat": 12, "cg": true}, {"label": "「夠啦，簽。」", "next": "ending_m_c", "tension": 4}]}, "m4c": {"id": "m4c", "label": "只簽紙", "scene": "lounge", "text": "「明智。紙簽完，人當未傾。」Elise 收回手。", "thought": "距離重新拉開。", "aside": "筆帽蓋返。", "choices": [{"label": "「聽日見。」", "next": "ending_m_c", "tension": 4}, {"label": "「……再傾一次人。」", "next": "m4b", "heat": 10, "cg": true}]}, "m5v": {"id": "m5v", "label": "玻璃涼", "scene": "lounge", "text": "Elise 指尖輕觸玻璃。\n\n「涼？你自己碰。碰完就唔好再問熱唔熱。」", "thought": "涼同熱，分開計。", "aside": "玻璃上霧再濃。", "choices": [{"label": "「我碰完。簽。」", "next": "m6a", "heat": 14, "requireHeat": 35, "cg": true}, {"label": "「夠啦。」", "next": "ending_m_c", "tension": 4}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["碰完", "簽", "我碰完", "量完"], "next": "m6a", "heat": 14, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……碰完。簽。"}, {"keys": ["夠", "夠啦", "走", "返"], "next": "ending_m_c", "tension": 4, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……夠。好。"}, {"keys": ["再碰", "再一次", "再量"], "next": "m6b", "heat": 16, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……再碰一次。你記得。"}]}, "m6a": {"id": "m6a", "label": "私人樓層", "scene": "lounge", "text": "Elise 帶你入私人樓層。「呢層無鏡頭。單同人，你握。」", "thought": "私人位，規矩自己定。", "aside": "電梯門噁一聲。", "choices": [{"label": "「繼續。」", "next": "m7a", "heat": 12, "cg": true}, {"label": "「簽完算。」", "next": "ending_m_a", "tension": 4}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["繼續", "入", "私人", "近"], "next": "m7a", "heat": 12, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……繼續。好。"}, {"keys": ["簽", "算", "走", "返"], "next": "ending_m_a", "tension": 4, "bucket": "leave", "ack": "……簽完算。得。"}]}, "m6b": {"id": "m6b", "label": "窗邊再量", "scene": "lounge", "text": "「窗邊再量一次熱唔熱。」Elise 指尖停玻璃上。", "thought": "再量一次，揀選權喇你。", "aside": "霧更濃。", "choices": [{"label": "「再量。」", "next": "m7a", "heat": 14, "cg": true}, {"label": "「夠啦。」", "next": "ending_m_b", "tension": 4}], "freeChat": true, "intents": [{"keys": ["再量", "量", "近", "碰"], "next": "m7a", "heat": 14, "bucket": "heat", "ack": "……再量。"}, {"keys": ["夠", "夠啦", "走", "返"], "next": "ending_m_b", "tension": 4, "bucket": "leave", "ack":